WEBVTT

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:30.000
(Laughter)

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:32.280
Let's get that one out of there. 
How about a chimpanzee?

00:04:32.280 --> 00:04:34.000
E: Ooh, ooh, ooh. Aah, aah, aah.

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:35.000
SW: Very good.

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:36.000
(Laughter)

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:37.000
What about a wolf?

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:37.730
E: Ooooowww.

00:04:37.730 --> 00:04:38.650
SW: And a pig?

00:04:38.650 --> 00:04:40.000
E: Oink, oink, oink.

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:41.000
SW: And the rooster?

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:42.550
E: Cock-a-doodle-doo!

00:04:42.550 --> 00:04:44.370
SW: And how about those cats?

00:04:44.370 --> 00:04:45.160
E: Meow.

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:46.000
(Laughter)

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:48.495
SW: At the zoo we have 
big cats from the jungle.

00:04:48.495 --> 00:04:49.433
E: Grrrrr.

00:04:49.433 --> 00:04:50.910
(Laughter)

00:04:51.430 --> 00:04:52.500
SW: What about a skunk?

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:53.500
E: Stinker.

00:04:53.550 --> 00:04:54.550
(Laughter)

00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:59.100
SW: She's a comedian. I suppose 
you think you're famous? Are you famous?

00:04:59.100 --> 00:05:00.000
E: Superstar.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:01.200
SW: Yeah. You are a superstar.